      "terms": "Appearance / shining forth: inner spiritual reality made perceptible. Wisdom / beauty / virtue: knowledge, artistic revelation and spiritual realization through will. Daimon: a spiritual source of inspiration in the tragedy argument. Karma: a person's consequential relation with the world, including the continuing life of spoken words.",
