      "answer": "All three illustrate Steiner’s proposed passage between sensory phenomena and spiritual activity. Colour and tone become routes of inward participation; the advocate supplies an event through which spirit allegedly enters earthly life. The factual and spiritual layers of that story should remain distinct."
